\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs28\b INSTALL PHIL'S PARATEXT TOOLS 2.2: USER GUIDE\b0\fs22\par
\par
\b PURPOSE\b0\par
Install_Phils_tools.exe is one program that installs, updates and removes all of Phil's plugins for Paratext 9. Each plugin adds an item to the Tools menu of a project's window in Paratext.\par
It finds every Paratext 9 on the computer and installs into each of them. Before installing, it checks every file against the checksum it carries, so a damaged or changed file is never installed.\par
The descriptions of the plugins are in Paratext_Plugins.rtf, in the same folder as the installer.\par
\par
\b GETTING THE INSTALLER\b0\par
1. Open the Paratext Plugins folder on Google Drive (https://short.do/HgUb7T) and click Install_Phils_tools.exe.\par
2. Click the Download button at the top. Google Drive warns about every program file: click "Download anyway".\par
3. Save the file in your Downloads folder.\par
4. Close Paratext.\par
5. Double-click Install_Phils_tools.exe. Windows may say that it protected your PC, because the program is not signed yet. Click "More info", check that the app is Install_Phils_tools.exe, then click "Run anyway".\par
\par
